{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §3.3.1 (one reference constructor, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    The kernel has one reference constructor, `meta.ref`, and declares no `meta.reference_type`: a construction tagged
    with that name names no entry of the schema's namespace, an unresolved reference. The same reference is
    `!meta.ref { of: order }`, or `meta.ref<order>`.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
